{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26245","headline":"送白舍人渡江 · 殷尧藩","name":"送白舍人渡江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓发龙江第一程，诸公同济似登瀛。\n海门日上千峰出，桃叶波平一棹轻。\n横锁已沈王濬筏，投鞭难阻谢玄兵。\n片时喜得东风便，回首钟声隔凤城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}